From 4d5081d065e7d4e913d3aa6a58f475eabfa9f5dd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Robert Jaszczurek <robert.jaszczurek@elastic.co>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 11:53:52 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat: headless SVG rendering for server-side chart
 previews

Adds `renderChart`, which renders a chart's specs to an SVG string without a
browser. XY, partition, heatmap, goal, bullet, metric and wordcloud charts are
supported, with legends. Text can be drawn as glyph outlines so the output does
not depend on the fonts installed on the server.
